# Mode 6 (listing 4712-4897), timer path. Entry text 3033, sound tabc50 (id 42); sweep 2 ends at frame 682 (measured): countdown
# text 3032, timer 30.45 s -> expiry at 682 + 3045 = 3727 (mode 3). The prison window chase (ControlNotifyTimerExpired every 0.2 s = 20 frames) advances the
# group's message_field 0..3 and wraps, first step 20 frames after the sweep end. a_sink18 with fewer than 4 windows lit does nothing.
# The a_sink18 hit is at 3700, after the whole chase and 27 frames before the timer expiry, so the timer path (3727:
# mode 6 -> 3) is measured undisturbed. a_sink18's control is PrisonSinkControl2 (dragon_tower_sinks.cpp:101-123): in
# mode 6 it runs PrisonMode6 (:69-80), which plays the sink sound (id 43, 'TowerSink' tabc51wave) and resets the eject
# timer of a_sink1 or a_sink2 (one RandIndex(2) draw). The hit is a bare event, no ball is captured, and
# TSink::TimerExpired creates a ball at the sink (TSink.cpp:78-96); a hit in the middle of the chase would put a third,
# unheld ball in play that drains and ends mode 6 early. The sink check: the mode controller does not complete the mode
# with fewer than 4 windows lit (mode == 6 after the hit; sink sound 43). The eject ball it creates appears after the end
# of the check window (3900 > quit at 3800).
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init watch prison_window_light_group.message_field
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
200 key down plunger
300 key up plunger
400 event a_spot4 ControlCollision
410 poke a_kout2 message_field 6
420 type NMAX
470 expect mode == 6
470 expect ball_held == 1
423 expect text info_text_box display id 3033
423 expect sound 42
# Track slot identity (0x439ae4/ae8/aec/af4) is pinned by the disassembly, not by this run: the run only shows that a track event is logged at the entry frame (slot 0).
423 expect track 0
# Entry ScoreValue(0,100000) (port_listing_dragon.c); gem amounts are not asserted (a gem event's n_score also holds the sink and part scores of the same frame).
423 expect n_score == 100000 delta 422
682 expect text info_text_box display id 3032
681 expect ball_held == 1
702 expect prison_window_light_group.message_field == 1
722 expect prison_window_light_group.message_field == 2
742 expect prison_window_light_group.message_field == 3
762 expect prison_window_light_group.message_field == 0
700 place 0 3.0 8.0 0.37 0 1 5 0x1
700 place 1 -3.0 8.0 0.37 0 1 5 0x1
701 hold 0 on
701 hold 1 on
3700 event a_sink18 ControlCollision
3700-3700 expect sound 43
3701 expect mode == 6
3726 expect mode == 6
3728 expect mode == 3
3800 quit
